201.5 738.2400000000000091 Td
(MODEL ANSWER:) Tj
T* (An Individual Case Safety Report \(ICSR\) is considered valid for triage and regulatory reporting if and only) Tj
T* (if all 4 minimum elements are present:) Tj
T* (1. An Identifiable Patient \(initials, age, DOB, gender, or patient ID number\).) Tj
T* (2. An Identifiable Reporter \(name, contact info, healthcare professional qualification, or consumer tag\).) Tj
T* (3. At least one Suspect Medicinal Product \(brand or generic drug name, dose, or batch\).) Tj
T* (4. At least one Adverse Event or Reaction.) Tj
T* (If any one of these four is missing, the case is marked non-valid/potential and assigned for follow-up) Tj
T* (query generation.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (INTERVIEWER TIP: Mention that 'Day 0' \(Clock Start\) begins the exact calendar day all 4 elements are) Tj
T* (received by any representative of the marketing authorization holder \(MAH\).) Tj
