(Q2. What is the exact clinical and) Tj
T* (regulatory difference between an Adverse) Tj
T* (Event \(AE\) and an Adverse Drug Reaction) Tj
T* (\(ADR\)?) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Category: Pharmacovigilance & Case) Tj
T* (Safety) Tj
