(MODEL ANSWER:) Tj
T* (Oracle Argus Safety 8.4 is the global gold-standard pharmacovigilance safety platform for managing,) Tj
T* (tracking, and reporting adverse event data across clinical trials and post-marketing surveillance.) Tj
T* (Key modules include:) Tj
T* (1. Argus Intake & Triage: Ingests electronic E2B files, paper forms, and literature reports.) Tj
T* (2. Case Processing: Captures patient demographics, drug administration details, medical history, lab data,) Tj
T* (and MedDRA coding.) Tj
T* (3. Narrative Writing Tab: Generates structured chronological clinical summary narratives.) Tj
