T* (• Pharmacovigilance \(PV\): Focuses on patient safety, adverse event intake, medical evaluation, causality) Tj
T* (assessment, and regulatory compliance \(FDA/EMA expedited filings\). Driven by safety physicians, clinical) Tj
T* (pharmacologists, and PV associates working in Oracle Argus.) Tj
T* (• Clinical Data Management \(CDM\): Focuses on the accuracy, consistency, integrity, and completeness of) Tj
T* (all clinical trial data \(vitals, labs, efficacy endpoints, demographic logs\) collected via eCRFs. Driven by) Tj
T* (data managers working in Electronic Data Capture \(EDC\) systems like Medidata RAVE or Oracle InForm) Tj
T* (to lock the trial database for biostatistical analysis.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (INTERVIEWER TIP: Highlight SAE Reconciliation—the exact intersection where PV associates and CDM) Tj
T* (coordinators cross-check adverse event dates, terms, and codes between Argus and RAVE.) Tj
