(MODEL ANSWER:) Tj
T* (Medidata RAVE is the leading cloud-based Electronic Data Capture \(EDC\) system used in clinical trials to) Tj
T* (capture patient case report forms \(eCRFs\).) Tj
T* (Query Lifecycle in RAVE:) Tj
T* (1. System/Edit Check Query: Automated logic check fires instantly if data violates parameters \(e.g.,) Tj
T* (systolic BP entered as 2500 or end date preceding start date\).) Tj
T* (2. Manual Query: Raised by a Clinical Data Coordinator upon reviewing inconsistent clinical logs or) Tj
T* (missing lab values.) Tj
T* (3. Site Response: The clinical site investigator or coordinator reviews the query, clarifies data, or amends) Tj
T* (the entry.) Tj
T* (4. Query Closure: CDM validates the revised entry and formally closes the query.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (INTERVIEWER TIP: Clarify that once all queries are closed and Source Data Verification \(SDV\) is 100%) Tj
T* (complete, the database moves through Soft Lock to Final Hard Lock.) Tj
